MONOLITHIC V/S MICROSERVICES 

In the past applications were built using monolithic architecture where everything was interconnected and bundled into one big codebase , this made updates risky for e.g if u wanted to change just the payment modules in an e commerce app you had to redoloy the entire application , a small bug could crash the whole system 

